    "sections": {
        "description": "NewsLunar is a modern, responsive, SEO-friendly WordPress magazine and news theme for news portals, online magazines, newspapers, blogs, editorial websites, and content publishers. Perfect for breaking news, latest news, trending news, technology, business, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, politics, health, travel, fashion, finance, education, and multi-category blogs. Features a clean, fast, mobile-friendly, customizable, and professional magazine layout with featured posts, news blocks, category sections, post grids, widgets, sidebars, social media integration, and modern typography."
